{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2021-05-01 00:09:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION OF UNITED RENTALS, INC. - URI', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JUAN MONTEVERDE , FOUNDER AND MANAGING PARTNER AT MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC, A NATIONAL SECURITIES FIRM RATED\xa0TOP 50\xa0IN THE 2018-2020 ISS SECURITIES CLASS ACTION SERVICES REPORT AND HEADQUARTERED AT THE\xa0EMPIRE STATE BUILDING\xa0IN NEW YORK CITY, IS INVESTIGATING\xa0UNITED RENTALS, INC. ("URI" OR THE "COMPANY") ( URI )\xa0RELATING TO ITS PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF GENERAL FINANCE CORP (GFN). UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, GFN SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE $19.00 PER SHARE THEY OWN.'}